68 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 49 0 R
/E (As Maharashtra embarks on a dynamic new chapter in its economic journey, the Maharashtra Export Policy stands as a testament to the state's unwavering commitment to fostering a thriving export ecosystem. This policy reflects not just the aspirations of the government, but also the collective dreams and ambitions of countless stakeholders who drive the engine of our export success.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
69 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 49 0 R
/E (Whether you are a seasoned exporter navigating the complexities of the global market, an MSME or a manufacturer poised for expansion, an aspiring entrepreneur brimming with innovative ideas, or a service provider catering to the needs of the export sector, this policy is designed to empower you and pave the way for your success.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
70 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /Figure
/P 49 0 R
/Pg 10 0 R
/A [336 0 R 0]
/K [3]
