/P 49 0 R
/E (A Catalyst for Growth )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
72 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 49 0 R
/E (The policy is not simply a collection of initiatives; it is a roadmap to a future where Maharashtra is recognized as a leading global exporter. We are committed to doubling our export potential from $72 billion to $150 billion within five years, a target that will unlock unprecedented opportunities for businesses, create new jobs and drive economic prosperity across the state.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
73 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 49 0 R
/E (Ensuring Stakeholder Empowerment )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
74 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 49 0 R
/E (We value the pivotal role of each stakeholder in this initiative. Establishing specialized export centres in districts is our strategy to offer tailored aid and resources to businesses, irrespective of their scale or locality. Our financial support initiatives drive innovation and infrastructure, while export incentives motivate engagement in global trade events and exhibitions.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
